WEBVTT

00:15.390 --> 00:17.720
This is nice! Sparks are flying!

00:18.200 --> 00:19.610
What's "nice" about it?

00:20.130 --> 00:23.250
But you slipped up, Sakura,
saying you'd become top dog…

00:25.660 --> 00:27.670
And right in front of Sugishita.

00:28.800 --> 00:29.680
Nice try.

00:29.900 --> 00:33.000
Sugishita's been visiting
here since middle school,

00:33.410 --> 00:35.760
and in recognition of his passion and skill,

00:36.180 --> 00:41.090
he was the only person allowed to
call himself Bofurin before officially starting.

00:41.840 --> 00:44.490
And his loyalty to the current top dog,

00:44.570 --> 00:45.340
or, rather,

00:45.690 --> 00:46.960
his worship of him,

00:47.290 --> 00:49.610
goes so far that he earned a nickname.

00:50.000 --> 00:52.090
The top dog's Fanatic.

00:54.890 --> 00:57.620
And if you tell him you're gunning for top dog…

00:58.100 --> 01:00.020
Quit egging them on! Stop them!

01:00.270 --> 01:02.400
Whaaat? Why don't you do it?

01:02.540 --> 01:03.910
There's no way we could!

01:04.350 --> 01:08.100
If you don't stop them fast,
that outsider's gonna get killed!

01:14.120 --> 01:15.900
Nice whiff.

01:24.160 --> 01:25.410
The Fanatic, huh?

01:26.080 --> 01:28.720
So basically you can't think for yourself.

01:29.130 --> 01:31.480
Can't choose for yourself. I got that right?

01:32.160 --> 01:33.480
You really think…

01:34.550 --> 01:36.140
a guy like that can beat me?

03:16.320 --> 03:18.020
S-Sakura…

03:19.370 --> 03:20.600
Test, test…

03:21.080 --> 03:24.250
1, 2, 3! 3, 2, 3! 1, 3, 2, 3!

03:25.340 --> 03:28.170
So I just hafta press this button, right?

03:28.650 --> 03:30.330
Wait, it's already on?!

03:30.690 --> 03:32.050
You gotta tell me first!

03:32.140 --> 03:33.040
I did!

03:33.500 --> 03:34.450
What now?

03:36.700 --> 03:39.810
Welcome to Furin, gentlemen!

03:39.990 --> 03:42.780
You're way too loud, dumbass! Talk normally!

03:42.840 --> 03:45.720
What? But it's my first address…

03:45.830 --> 03:49.390
You're loud enough as-is.
We're gonna get noise complaints!

03:50.170 --> 03:52.710
Guys interrupted me right at the good part.

03:53.190 --> 03:54.590
What are they even doing?

03:55.370 --> 03:57.300
Come on, let's get back to it!

04:02.050 --> 04:03.920
What the… The vibe's different.

04:04.890 --> 04:06.100
Who is this guy?

04:08.530 --> 04:10.800
Well, then, starting over…

04:12.850 --> 04:15.910
I'm Bofurin's primo, Umemiya Hajime.

04:17.200 --> 04:19.220
He's Furin's top dog!

04:19.880 --> 04:22.360
The strongest guy in Furin!

04:23.220 --> 04:24.580
Uhhhh…

04:27.080 --> 04:29.480
Sorry, forgot what I was gonna say!

04:30.590 --> 04:31.520
Oh, right!

04:32.050 --> 04:32.730
Everyone!

04:33.080 --> 04:33.310
[Enjoy]

04:33.310 --> 04:34.590
[Enjoy]
Enjoy your youth! Enjoy it!

04:34.590 --> 04:35.830
[Youth]
Enjoy your youth! Enjoy it!

04:35.830 --> 04:37.590
[Enjoy youth]

04:37.900 --> 04:39.980
I mean, you're in high school!

04:40.320 --> 04:43.250
Make a lot of memories! Live a life that matters!

04:43.720 --> 04:47.730
Maybe take a trip to the beach or mountains!
I like the beach, by the way!

04:48.010 --> 04:49.880
Ah, either or, for me.

04:50.050 --> 04:53.240
Alright, this summer we're all hitting the beach!

04:53.390 --> 04:54.930
Let's grab shaved ice!

04:55.480 --> 04:56.920
Shaved ice, he says…

04:58.650 --> 05:00.610
Somethin' funny, punk?

05:00.650 --> 05:01.160
No, no!

05:01.160 --> 05:02.350
- Hunh?!
- Not at all!

05:02.460 --> 05:06.690
I am very very grateful for your
god-slash-Buddha's generous words!

05:06.950 --> 05:10.080
Oh, I said we'd all go out of habit,

05:10.750 --> 05:13.770
but with this many people
there'd be some butting heads.

05:13.960 --> 05:15.850
That may happen a lot from here on.

05:15.850 --> 05:16.210
[Stare]

05:16.210 --> 05:20.240
[Stare]
But hey, there probably
won't be any fistfights day one!

05:20.240 --> 05:20.810
[Scrub]

05:20.810 --> 05:22.660
[Scrub]
I won't tell you to be friendly,

05:22.660 --> 05:23.940
[Scrub]
but try to get along.

05:24.370 --> 05:27.310
Wipe all the blood you want,
we all saw you fighting.

05:27.480 --> 05:30.640
What gives?! This guy threw the first punch!

05:30.990 --> 05:32.400
Anyway, moving on…

05:32.770 --> 05:34.690
I gotta say this, if nothing else.

05:35.880 --> 05:36.900
Everyone…

05:37.690 --> 05:38.890
Defend the town.

05:40.550 --> 05:43.670
We were given the name Bofurin.

05:44.470 --> 05:45.620
And under that name,

05:45.810 --> 05:49.800
you will protect people, property,
feelings, and everything important.

05:50.460 --> 05:53.200
That is this school's one and only rule.

05:53.810 --> 05:54.690
Yessir!

05:56.020 --> 05:58.200
That's all! See ya 'round!

05:59.050 --> 06:01.710
Alright, that's done. Let's go grab lunch!

06:01.790 --> 06:03.300
The mic's still hot, man!

06:04.550 --> 06:05.890
He's not even in here.

06:05.890 --> 06:07.350
- Holy crap, Umemiya's so cool!
- He's not even in here.

06:07.350 --> 06:09.010
- Holy crap, Umemiya's so cool!
- Why's everyone in lock step?

06:09.320 --> 06:10.680
- Well, duh!
- Can being a strong fighter do all this?

06:10.680 --> 06:12.110
- It's so obvious!
- Can being a strong fighter do all this?

06:13.100 --> 06:15.700
Umemiya… What kind of guy is he?

06:16.770 --> 06:18.190
Hey, there, you two.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.170
Shouldn't you make up?

06:20.610 --> 06:21.590
I know! How about a handshake?

06:21.590 --> 06:23.010
[Squeeze]
I know! How about a handshake?

06:23.010 --> 06:25.150
[Squeeze]
A great, youthful show of understanding!

06:25.230 --> 06:26.040
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

06:26.140 --> 06:27.690
Why would I shake his hand?!

06:27.810 --> 06:30.660
There's no understanding! It's not even over yet!

06:30.820 --> 06:32.710
And he threw the first punch!

06:33.100 --> 06:35.200
Why's your face all red, Sakura?

06:36.110 --> 06:38.390
If you're aiming to be top dog,

06:38.750 --> 06:40.390
then this should be trivial.

06:42.140 --> 06:46.400
Sugishita, if I told Umemiya
that you threw hands at a classmate,

06:46.690 --> 06:48.530
what do you think he'd say?

07:01.110 --> 07:03.310
You… wanna shake hands?

07:04.790 --> 07:05.510
For reals?

07:06.100 --> 07:09.390
Sakura, h-h-hurry and shake his hand!

07:10.150 --> 07:12.130
I just… have to grab it, right?

07:13.060 --> 07:15.890
Not slap it or throw him?

07:16.890 --> 07:18.890
Touching people outside of a fight…

07:21.830 --> 07:23.330
This feels so weird.

07:29.340 --> 07:29.600
[Grr]

07:29.600 --> 07:31.870
[Grrr]
That's good! Your youth's burning bright!

07:31.870 --> 07:32.200
[Grrr]

07:32.210 --> 07:33.480
[Grrr]
What's good about this?!

07:34.790 --> 07:36.030
- Is he a gorilla?!
- Is he a gorilla?!

07:39.960 --> 07:41.310
Sakura!

07:41.570 --> 07:43.190
That hurt! The hell are you…!

07:43.280 --> 07:46.990
You're incredible! You actually
landed a hit on Sugishita!

07:47.230 --> 07:48.890
That kick was intense!

07:48.920 --> 07:50.610
Man, you're flexible!

07:51.000 --> 07:52.870
I bet he could do a walking bridge!

07:53.070 --> 07:54.450
- I can do that!
- But now that I think about it…

07:54.450 --> 07:55.890
- Don't even try!
- But now that I think about it…

07:56.500 --> 07:59.500
It's been like this the whole time
since I came here…

08:06.050 --> 08:07.490
What's up? You went quiet.

08:07.720 --> 08:11.110
Y-You didn't choke him out, did you?!

08:13.280 --> 08:15.170
That wouldn't choke anyone out!

08:15.660 --> 08:18.890
I didn't realize other people…

08:19.570 --> 08:20.610
were so warm.

08:21.080 --> 08:22.630
Hey, jerrrrrks!

08:22.990 --> 08:25.080
We're goin' outside. Outside!

08:25.810 --> 08:28.230
Huh? We just got in here!

08:28.760 --> 08:29.610
And who're you?

08:31.980 --> 08:34.690
Sakura, the paint's uneven there.

08:34.930 --> 08:35.760
What even…

08:35.950 --> 08:37.700
I got us more paint!

08:37.970 --> 08:38.700
Why this?

08:39.400 --> 08:41.510
Wow, Nire, you're good at this.

08:42.370 --> 08:43.260
You mean it?

08:44.010 --> 08:46.410
What's going on here?

08:54.980 --> 08:56.470
[30 minutes ago]

08:56.470 --> 08:57.970
[30 minutes ago]
Tch. What gives?

08:58.080 --> 09:00.780
We only just got to the classroom.

09:00.910 --> 09:02.000
Pipe down!

09:02.920 --> 09:05.720
Quit yammerrrin' and get to the schoolyarrrd!

09:05.820 --> 09:09.680
If you'rrre too slow, I'll get an earrrful, too!

09:09.680 --> 09:10.910
Talk about rolling R's!

09:11.230 --> 09:12.890
Get movin' already!

09:15.240 --> 09:21.130
It took you seven minutes,
forty-eight-point-two-six seconds to get outside.

09:21.770 --> 09:24.290
Preschoolers move faster than that!

09:25.060 --> 09:26.790
He included the point-two-six?

09:27.110 --> 09:28.380
Talk about detailed!

09:31.190 --> 09:32.440
I saw him yesterday…

09:32.580 --> 09:34.740
Wait, Sakura, you know him?

09:35.140 --> 09:37.590
From when I saved the girl from the cafe.

09:37.900 --> 09:39.630
Oh, you mean Kotoha?

09:40.230 --> 09:40.930
[Thud]

09:43.330 --> 09:44.150
[Zoom]

09:46.030 --> 09:47.090
Ow, dammit!

09:47.470 --> 09:48.420
What's your beef?!

09:48.460 --> 09:53.070
I told you to never, ever
tell anyone Kotoha was there!

09:53.260 --> 09:55.300
Gross, dude! Stop spitting on me!

09:55.360 --> 09:56.950
You just don't get it, kid!

09:56.950 --> 09:58.710
What are they talking about?

09:58.770 --> 09:59.700
Makes you wonder.

09:59.700 --> 10:03.200
If… If it gets out Kotoha was in danger,

10:03.400 --> 10:05.970
it'll be a real pain in the ass, like I said!

10:07.190 --> 10:10.080
Anyway, Kotoha was never there!

10:10.320 --> 10:12.420
And never tell anyone about yesterday!

10:12.940 --> 10:14.180
Otherwise…

10:17.180 --> 10:18.910
I'll start coughing up blood.

10:20.010 --> 10:21.200
Dammit…

10:22.930 --> 10:25.840
I don't know what brought you to this town,

10:26.560 --> 10:29.810
but you enlisted under one hell of a general, kid.

10:30.810 --> 10:31.720
Huh…?

10:34.790 --> 10:36.890
What were you talking about, Sakura?

10:37.420 --> 10:38.310
Nothing.

10:38.400 --> 10:41.100
What?! Then what was he like?

10:41.590 --> 10:45.860
The type of weirdo to stress himself into
a stomachache, then take a Gaskun 10.

10:45.980 --> 10:47.130
Gaskun 10?

10:47.240 --> 10:48.560
The stomach medicine?!

10:48.770 --> 10:50.430
Why would you note that down?

10:50.710 --> 10:51.950
What do you mean, why?!

10:52.580 --> 10:57.050
Hiragi is one of this school's,
no, one of Bofurin's four devas!

10:57.470 --> 10:58.560
Four devas?!

10:59.070 --> 11:01.410
[Primo, Four Kings]
Umemiya sits at the top of Bofurin,

11:01.700 --> 11:03.890
[Primo, Four Kings]
and the four generals are under him.

11:04.340 --> 11:09.820
Each one basically acts like a captain
for all three years of a given class.

11:10.300 --> 11:12.980
So that makes us the first platoon, then?

11:13.230 --> 11:14.150
We're class one.

11:14.460 --> 11:15.350
Oh, no.

11:16.180 --> 11:18.700
Classes are named for Buddhism's four devas.

11:18.930 --> 11:24.890
Starting with class one, they are: Tamon Squad,
Jikoku Squad, Zocho Squad, and Komoku Squad.

11:25.420 --> 11:26.810
We're in Tamon Squad.

11:27.760 --> 11:29.550
Split into groups of four or five.

11:30.250 --> 11:33.630
Each group will get one third- or second-year.

11:34.110 --> 11:37.920
Follow them, and learn the procedures
and what to look out for.

11:38.320 --> 11:39.960
Come on, let's go.

11:40.510 --> 11:41.730
Go? Where?

11:41.940 --> 11:42.760
For what?

11:46.860 --> 11:48.210
Patrolling the town.

11:50.680 --> 11:52.100
Patrols aside,

11:52.930 --> 11:55.140
why's this guy with us?

11:55.580 --> 11:56.720
I already told you.

11:57.110 --> 11:59.970
Umemiya told me to keep a close eye on you two.

12:00.560 --> 12:01.660
You two're in my group.

12:01.670 --> 12:02.300
[Huh?!]
You two're in my group.

12:02.300 --> 12:03.460
[Huh?!]
Orders from Umemiya.

12:04.300 --> 12:06.500
You two already fought it out, yeah?

12:06.590 --> 12:07.710
We did not!

12:08.080 --> 12:10.900
He threw hands at me, so I kicked him! That's it!

12:13.640 --> 12:15.440
Enough already! Walk on opposite sides!

12:15.440 --> 12:16.230
[Push]
Enough already! Walk on opposite sides!

12:16.630 --> 12:18.530
He's like a nursery teacher.

12:18.660 --> 12:19.590
I ain't no nurse!

12:19.920 --> 12:23.760
Seriously, man, you call this
a patrol? We're just walking!

12:24.250 --> 12:29.390
If we're defending the town, shouldn't we be
going out to beat up would-be intruders?

12:29.690 --> 12:30.690
Dumbass.

12:31.090 --> 12:34.100
That's not defense, that's offense.

12:34.530 --> 12:35.130
Huh?

12:36.020 --> 12:38.190
Even just walking has meaning.

12:39.190 --> 12:41.710
Just by walking around in these uniforms,

12:41.920 --> 12:44.510
we can scare most smaller gangs away.

12:45.750 --> 12:47.110
When we fight,

12:47.520 --> 12:48.570
we're on defense.

12:49.630 --> 12:51.820
We don't need to make the first move.

12:54.930 --> 12:57.810
What a load of crap. Talk about boring.

12:57.990 --> 13:01.580
Only enjoying fights
doesn't make you much fun, either.

13:04.250 --> 13:06.070
[Step, step]
Whoa, there, granny!

13:06.470 --> 13:07.960
That's dangerous! Get down!

13:08.750 --> 13:09.890
Get over here, guys!

13:11.220 --> 13:13.100
Man, you guys are lifesavers.

13:13.570 --> 13:16.100
Every time I paint over it, we get tagged.

13:16.480 --> 13:18.450
At least it's less frequent now.

13:18.860 --> 13:19.830
No problem.

13:20.300 --> 13:21.480
What the hell!

13:21.720 --> 13:24.060
This is another part of Bofurin's job.

13:24.870 --> 13:26.080
Hey, boss.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.030
My wall's done.

13:28.790 --> 13:32.300
[Steamy]
Man, I owe you guys. Take these!

13:32.450 --> 13:33.220
Thankya!

13:34.230 --> 13:35.590
Thanks, boys!

13:42.920 --> 13:45.180
So, you only have fun when you fight?

13:45.930 --> 13:47.630
I mean, I get that.

13:48.730 --> 13:50.730
We used to be the same way.

13:51.590 --> 13:52.370
But y'know,

13:53.050 --> 13:56.220
talking to folks, needing them and being needed…

13:57.220 --> 13:59.100
That's pretty fun, too.

14:26.500 --> 14:28.810
All the bars are past here, aren't they?

14:30.760 --> 14:31.510
That a dog?

14:32.500 --> 14:34.190
What an ugly dog.

14:34.390 --> 14:35.590
Sakura, hey!

14:35.590 --> 14:36.000
[Pops out]

14:36.000 --> 14:37.560
[Pops out]
You can't say that!

14:37.560 --> 14:40.060
[Pops out]
You never know when they might be listening!

14:40.280 --> 14:41.080
Who's "they"?

14:41.540 --> 14:45.790
This is the border line between Bofurin's
and another team's territory!

14:46.280 --> 14:49.510
You absolutely must not cause
any problems past the tracks!

14:49.970 --> 14:54.450
They have their own rules over there,
like they're a whole different country!

14:55.000 --> 14:57.280
And the team that rules over there is…

14:58.440 --> 15:01.760
The Lion's Head, who believe
strength is everything!

15:02.490 --> 15:05.800
Huh. Strength is everything?

15:07.940 --> 15:10.410
Nice. I like that sorta thing.

15:10.900 --> 15:12.400
Stop right there!

15:15.150 --> 15:16.640
Third Middle's uniform?!

15:16.890 --> 15:19.410
What are you doing there?! Get over here, now!

15:22.460 --> 15:23.610
Ahh! Behind you!

15:24.040 --> 15:25.160
Orange jumpers…

15:25.670 --> 15:26.740
It's Lion's Head!

15:27.050 --> 15:29.990
Shit, he won't make it past the tracks…

15:36.170 --> 15:37.170
Tch!

15:44.680 --> 15:45.460
Wha?!

15:48.380 --> 15:50.510
The hell, man. You're in the way.

15:51.290 --> 15:55.930
What have they done?! We're not
supposed to interfere on their turf!

15:56.220 --> 15:59.290
What are you saying? If this kid's on our team,

16:00.170 --> 16:01.500
- they interfered first.
- they interfered first.

16:02.090 --> 16:03.000
Wha…

16:03.510 --> 16:04.480
Wha?!

16:06.270 --> 16:08.250
What are you two doing?!

16:08.520 --> 16:11.010
I'll handle the rest. Go away.

16:11.920 --> 16:12.650
Listen to me!

16:13.090 --> 16:16.510
Aw, man. What're you doing?

16:18.360 --> 16:21.240
He's done. Given up the ghost.

16:21.340 --> 16:24.120
Going down to one kick? Lame, dude!

16:24.830 --> 16:26.070
What's with them?

16:26.680 --> 16:28.790
Wasn't he one of theirs?

16:32.400 --> 16:34.110
What's all this?

16:34.400 --> 16:35.700
What happened?

16:37.390 --> 16:40.780
I saw one of our jumpers go flyin',

16:41.190 --> 16:43.300
so I came to check it out…

16:44.030 --> 16:46.690
This guy, of all people, showed up?

16:47.470 --> 16:49.280
Lion's Head's second-in-command,

16:50.010 --> 16:51.100
Togame Jo!

16:52.590 --> 16:55.340
And what's Furin doing on our side?

16:57.800 --> 16:58.610
Ehh?

16:59.150 --> 17:01.600
Saruwatari, what happened to you?

17:03.190 --> 17:04.510
What's this guy's deal?

17:07.160 --> 17:09.280
He was chasing one of ours.

17:11.280 --> 17:13.980
Oh, it's Hiragi.

17:14.480 --> 17:16.020
Hey, bud.

17:16.130 --> 17:19.410
What's with this guy?!
He's so laid-back it pisses me off!

17:20.120 --> 17:21.070
So, this…

17:22.270 --> 17:25.200
Did those two do it?

17:26.840 --> 17:29.100
This dude's no joke!

17:29.770 --> 17:30.730
Ow…

17:31.220 --> 17:33.850
You bastard, you broke the rules!

17:34.070 --> 17:36.830
No interfering in each other's territory!

17:37.120 --> 17:40.080
Past the tracks is Lion's Head territory!

17:40.350 --> 17:43.120
You don't get to act big on our turf!

17:52.710 --> 17:54.360
"Our" turf?

17:55.390 --> 17:57.080
You lost, didn't you?

17:58.640 --> 18:02.180
That means you're weak, doesn't it?

18:03.910 --> 18:05.880
You know what that means.

18:07.120 --> 18:08.820
The weak…

18:10.140 --> 18:10.960
Stop!

18:11.530 --> 18:13.340
Hm? What's up?

18:13.590 --> 18:16.680
Isn't he a member of your team?

18:17.750 --> 18:18.530
Huh?

18:19.750 --> 18:20.730
Who do you mean?

18:21.760 --> 18:23.610
This guy? No.

18:23.890 --> 18:25.440
He lost, after all.

18:26.050 --> 18:27.980
And losing…

18:28.380 --> 18:30.290
means you're weak.

18:30.980 --> 18:32.750
And Lion's Head…

18:33.710 --> 18:36.800
doesn't need the weak.

18:37.530 --> 18:39.480
Wh-What's that about?

18:40.010 --> 18:41.310
I'd heard about this,

18:41.860 --> 18:44.470
but I can't say it feels good to watch.

18:45.060 --> 18:46.280
So. Lame.

18:47.210 --> 18:50.480
I thought you guys believed
strength was everything.

18:52.580 --> 18:55.400
You think beating up the weak shows strength?

18:55.990 --> 19:00.230
Here I thought I finally found
a fun group. I'm disappointed.

19:05.700 --> 19:08.290
Disappointed, huh?

19:09.790 --> 19:12.920
Hey, we gonna kill him for sayin' that? Dead?

19:13.360 --> 19:16.270
Nah, it's all good.

19:16.970 --> 19:18.710
More importantly, you…

19:20.300 --> 19:22.580
That's one heck of a hairdo.

19:22.810 --> 19:23.720
Walking Reversi.

19:23.870 --> 19:25.260
Huh?! You just noticed?!

19:25.510 --> 19:29.310
Also you… You talk too fast.

19:29.310 --> 19:31.860
What?! You just talk too slow!

19:32.500 --> 19:34.400
See, like that.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.900
I barely caught any of that,

19:37.770 --> 19:39.540
and it pisses me off.

19:40.740 --> 19:42.130
Alright, I've decided.

19:42.980 --> 19:46.600
I'll beat you to a pulp in a proper venue.

19:47.460 --> 19:50.680
I've memorized your face.

19:51.490 --> 19:53.710
See you, Reversi kid.

19:56.680 --> 19:57.800
Reversi, my ass.

19:58.090 --> 20:01.800
What the hell, you two! What were you thinking?!

20:02.040 --> 20:04.970
This is gonna start a conflict, seriously!

20:05.100 --> 20:07.010
War, guys! War!

20:07.080 --> 20:09.760
That's enough, Nire. Let's calm down.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.730
I was a little late stepping out,

20:13.360 --> 20:15.990
but looking at that, I think it was for the best.

20:16.810 --> 20:19.480
Hiragi, don't exceed the recommended dose.

20:20.170 --> 20:22.920
Besides, Sakura, if you hadn't provoked him,

20:23.190 --> 20:25.780
you might have gotten off the hook for the kick!

20:27.810 --> 20:30.140
Togame's not kind enough for that.

20:31.160 --> 20:34.700
He's probably the most territorial
guy in Lion's Head.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.600
He wouldn't let it slide.

20:37.370 --> 20:38.660
[Slump]
Oh, he wouldn't?

20:39.240 --> 20:40.920
What's done is done.

20:41.690 --> 20:42.370
Besides,

20:43.300 --> 20:45.080
I should have moved first.

20:45.600 --> 20:46.140
Sorry.

20:48.210 --> 20:49.590
Head back to the school.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.030
As for you, Third Middle…

20:53.110 --> 20:54.330
It's Sasaki.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.180
Come with us, Sasaki.

20:57.910 --> 20:59.610
Tell Umemiya everything.

21:07.100 --> 21:10.150
Is he really that afraid
of reporting in to Umemiya?

21:11.030 --> 21:14.060
He sounded so easygoing on the broadcast.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.030
Umemiya…

21:17.190 --> 21:18.380
What's he like?

21:27.050 --> 21:27.620
Wha…

21:27.910 --> 21:29.200
What's all this?

21:30.300 --> 21:31.520
I-Incredible!

21:33.220 --> 21:33.960
Umemiya!

21:34.630 --> 21:37.400
Furin's top dog… Number one in the school!

21:38.700 --> 21:40.210
Oh, Hiragi!

21:40.540 --> 21:41.920
Check it out!

21:42.770 --> 21:45.590
The eggplants and peppers are doing great!

21:45.940 --> 21:47.670
Let's barbecue them with everyone this summer!

21:47.670 --> 21:48.370
[Grin]
Let's barbecue them with everyone this summer!

21:48.370 --> 21:49.100
Let's barbecue them with everyone this summer!

21:51.560 --> 21:53.710
He's like an elementary school kid.

21:54.100 --> 21:56.300
He's… strong?

21:56.920 --> 21:59.910
[#03: He Who Stands at the Peak]

23:31.090 --> 23:32.280
All that aside,

23:32.540 --> 23:35.520
what are you gonna do about this desk, Sakura?

23:36.100 --> 23:37.720
Why are you asking me?

23:37.890 --> 23:39.210
I didn't break it!

23:40.040 --> 23:44.620
Maybe not, but you're
the one who incited Sugishita.

23:44.820 --> 23:47.170
Whose side are you on, punk?!

23:47.380 --> 23:48.680
Complain to him!

23:49.290 --> 23:50.330
Hey, Sugishita!

23:51.060 --> 23:51.630
Hey!

23:54.410 --> 23:56.160
That rat bastard…

23:56.500 --> 23:59.120
He's pretending to be asleep!
